    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.poster.avif?t=1754666280\" width=480 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.webm?t=1754666280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.mp4?t=1754666280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE BASEMENT REMEMBERS</strong> <br>When you took the job as a receptionist in this sleepy town, the rented house seemed perfect. But the previous tenants\u2014a loving couple\u2014left behind more than just furniture. Their secrets are buried in the basement, and <i>she</i> wants you to uncover them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/d667b1bedf75a2012f7df0ea269da3d7.poster.avif?t=1754666280\" width=332 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/d667b1bedf75a2012f7df0ea269da3d7.webm?t=1754666280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/d667b1bedf75a2012f7df0ea269da3d7.mp4?t=1754666280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>A Psychological Horror Experience</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration:</strong> Navigate the decaying house, where every creak and shadow hides clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Storytelling:</strong> Piece together the tragic tale of the wife through diary entries, ghostly visions, and environmental storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles with Purpose:</strong> Solve riddles tied to the narrative\u2014unlock the basement, decipher cryptic notes, and confront the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haunting Encounters:</strong> Experience chilling events that escalate as you delve deeper. No cheap jump scares\u2014just relentless dread.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/feb8bc509406b5b5d94d10f8292c86ca.poster.avif?t=1754666280\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/feb8bc509406b5b5d94d10f8292c86ca.webm?t=1754666280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/feb8bc509406b5b5d94d10f8292c86ca.mp4?t=1754666280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;I just wanted to be loved...&quot;</strong> <br>The wife\u2019s spirit lingers, not as a monster, but as a desperate soul reliving her final days. Will you help her find peace, or become another victim of the basement\u2019s curse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/3a631400dc2750b2a0f8baa00f3b1255.poster.avif?t=1754666280\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/3a631400dc2750b2a0f8baa00f3b1255.webm?t=1754666280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/3a631400dc2750b2a0f8baa00f3b1255.mp4?t=1754666280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> <br>\ud83d\udd26 *3-5 hours* of immersive, story-driven horror. <br>\ud83d\udcd6 <i>Multiple endings</i> based on your choices. <br>\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <i>No combat</i>\u2014only your wits and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Basement is a love letter to classic psychological horror\u2014slow-burn, emotional, and deeply unsettling.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.poster.avif?t=1754666280\" width=480 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.webm?t=1754666280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.mp4?t=1754666280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE BASEMENT REMEMBERS</strong> <br>When you took the job as a receptionist in this sleepy town, the rented house seemed perfect. But the previous tenants\u2014a loving couple\u2014left behind more than just furniture. Their secrets are buried in the basement, and <i>she</i> wants you to uncover them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/d667b1bedf75a2012f7df0ea269da3d7.poster.avif?t=1754666280\" width=332 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/d667b1bedf75a2012f7df0ea269da3d7.webm?t=1754666280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/d667b1bedf75a2012f7df0ea269da3d7.mp4?t=1754666280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>A Psychological Horror Experience</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration:</strong> Navigate the decaying house, where every creak and shadow hides clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Storytelling:</strong> Piece together the tragic tale of the wife through diary entries, ghostly visions, and environmental storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles with Purpose:</strong> Solve riddles tied to the narrative\u2014unlock the basement, decipher cryptic notes, and confront the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haunting Encounters:</strong> Experience chilling events that escalate as you delve deeper. No cheap jump scares\u2014just relentless dread.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/feb8bc509406b5b5d94d10f8292c86ca.poster.avif?t=1754666280\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/feb8bc509406b5b5d94d10f8292c86ca.webm?t=1754666280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/feb8bc509406b5b5d94d10f8292c86ca.mp4?t=1754666280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;I just wanted to be loved...&quot;</strong> <br>The wife\u2019s spirit lingers, not as a monster, but as a desperate soul reliving her final days. Will you help her find peace, or become another victim of the basement\u2019s curse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/3a631400dc2750b2a0f8baa00f3b1255.poster.avif?t=1754666280\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/3a631400dc2750b2a0f8baa00f3b1255.webm?t=1754666280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/3a631400dc2750b2a0f8baa00f3b1255.mp4?t=1754666280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> <br>\ud83d\udd26 *3-5 hours* of immersive, story-driven horror. <br>\ud83d\udcd6 <i>Multiple endings</i> based on your choices. <br>\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <i>No combat</i>\u2014only your wits and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Basement is a love letter to classic psychological horror\u2014slow-burn, emotional, and deeply unsettling.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
